WEBVTT

00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:08.475
P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Where are you going?

00:00:08.555 --> 00:00:10.875
To P. Sherman,
42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.

00:00:10.955 --> 00:00:13.275
If you ask where I'm going, I'll tell you.

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:18.675
P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Where? I'm sorry. I didn't hear you.

00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:21.995
Excuse me. Excuse me.

00:00:22.075 --> 00:00:24.435
Hi. Do you know how to get... Hello?

00:00:24.515 --> 00:00:27.275
Wait. Can you tell me... Hey!

00:00:27.355 --> 00:00:28.715
Hold it!

00:00:28.835 --> 00:00:30.755
Wait a minute. I'm trying to talk to you.

00:00:31.515 --> 00:00:33.395
Okay, fellas. Come back here.

00:00:33.475 --> 00:00:37.315
One quick question. I need to...
And they're gone again.

00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:40.715
P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.

00:00:40.795 --> 00:00:42.955
Why do I have to tell you again?

00:00:43.035 --> 00:00:46.555
-I don't get tired of it.
-All right, here's the thing.

00:00:47.475 --> 00:00:51.875
I think it's best
if I carry on from here by...

00:00:53.035 --> 00:00:55.315
-By myself.
-Okay.

00:00:55.395 --> 00:00:56.955
You know. Alone.

00:00:57.035 --> 00:01:01.915
Without... Well, not without you,
but I don't want you with me.

00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:06.155
-Huh?
-I don't want to hurt your feelings.

00:01:06.235 --> 00:01:08.955
-You want me to leave?
-Well, not... Yes. Yeah.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:11.555
I just can't afford any more delays.

00:01:11.675 --> 00:01:14.515
You're one of
those fish that cause delays.

00:01:14.635 --> 00:01:17.675
Sometimes it's a good thing.
There's a group of fish.

00:01:17.755 --> 00:01:20.235
-They're delay fish.
-You mean...

00:01:21.075 --> 00:01:24.555
-You mean you don't like me?
-Of course I like you.

00:01:24.635 --> 00:01:27.115
Because I like you
I don't want to be with you.

00:01:27.195 --> 00:01:29.395
It's a complicated emotion.

00:01:30.835 --> 00:01:33.195
Don't cry. I like you.

00:01:33.275 --> 00:01:34.435
Hey, you!

00:01:35.115 --> 00:01:37.515
Lady, is this guy bothering you?

00:01:37.595 --> 00:01:41.515
-I don't remember. Were you?
-No, no. We're just...

00:01:41.595 --> 00:01:43.435
Do you guys know how I can get...

00:01:43.515 --> 00:01:47.275
We're talking to the lady, not you.
You like impressions?

00:01:47.835 --> 00:01:48.875
Mmm-hmm.

00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:51.875
Okay.
Just like in rehearsals, gentlemen.

00:01:51.955 --> 00:01:53.595
What are we? Take a guess.

00:01:53.675 --> 00:01:56.795
-DORY: I've seen one of those.
-I'm a fish with a nose like a sword.

00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:58.835
-Wait.
-It's a swordfish.

00:01:58.915 --> 00:02:01.435
Hey, clown-boy, let the lady guess.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:03.435
Where's the butter?

00:02:03.995 --> 00:02:05.835
-It's on the tip of my tongue.
-Lobster.

00:02:05.915 --> 00:02:07.275
-Saw that.
-What?

00:02:07.355 --> 00:02:09.435
-Lots of legs.
-DORY: Clam?

00:02:09.515 --> 00:02:10.715
Close enough.

00:02:10.795 --> 00:02:13.275
♪ It's a whale of a tale
I'll tell you, lad ♪

00:02:13.355 --> 00:02:15.635
-They're good.
-Somebody give me directions?

00:02:16.355 --> 00:02:19.515
-"Would somebody give me directions?"
-(DORY LAUGHS)

00:02:19.595 --> 00:02:21.875
-I'm serious.
-Blah, blah, me, me.

00:02:21.995 --> 00:02:23.435
Blah, blah, blah, me, me.

00:02:23.515 --> 00:02:25.115
Thank you.

00:02:25.195 --> 00:02:27.435
Oh, dear. Hey, come back.

00:02:28.315 --> 00:02:30.315
What's the matter?

00:02:30.395 --> 00:02:32.555
While they're doing impressions,

00:02:32.635 --> 00:02:34.155
I am miles from home

00:02:34.235 --> 00:02:36.315
with a fish that can't even
remember her own name.

00:02:36.475 --> 00:02:39.115
-I bet that's frustrating.
-My son is out there.

00:02:39.195 --> 00:02:41.115
-Your son Chico?
-Nemo.

00:02:41.195 --> 00:02:44.875
It doesn't matter. 'Cause no fish
in this ocean is going to help me.

00:02:44.955 --> 00:02:46.635
I'm helping you.

00:02:48.555 --> 00:02:50.315
Wait right here.

00:02:51.595 --> 00:02:53.675
-Guys.
-Is he bothering you again?

00:02:53.755 --> 00:02:55.355
No, he's a good guy.

00:02:55.435 --> 00:02:57.795
Go easy on him.
He's lost his son Fabio.

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:00.435
Heard of P. Sherman,
42 Wallaby Way, Sydney?

00:03:00.515 --> 00:03:02.875
Sydney? Oh, sure.

00:03:02.955 --> 00:03:05.915
Ted here's got relatives in Sydney.
Don't you, Ted?

00:03:05.995 --> 00:03:09.315
-Sure do.
-Hey, they know Sydney!

00:03:09.395 --> 00:03:13.035
-You wouldn't know how to get there?
-Follow the EAC.

00:03:13.115 --> 00:03:15.755
That's East Australian Current.

00:03:15.835 --> 00:03:18.875
Big current. You can't miss it. It's in

00:03:18.955 --> 00:03:20.435
that direction.

00:03:20.515 --> 00:03:23.035
Then you got to follow that for about...

00:03:23.115 --> 00:03:25.875
What do you guys think?
Three leagues?

00:03:25.955 --> 00:03:29.035
That baby's going to
float you right past Sydney.

00:03:29.115 --> 00:03:30.635
MARLIN: Great! That's great!

00:03:30.715 --> 00:03:32.795
-Dory, you did it.
-Oh, please.

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:35.075
I'm just your little helper. Helping along.

00:03:35.155 --> 00:03:37.435
-Fellas, thank you.
-Don't mention it.

00:03:37.515 --> 00:03:39.955
Just loosen up. Okay, buddy?

00:03:40.035 --> 00:03:43.155
You guys! You really nailed him. Bye.

00:03:43.235 --> 00:03:44.795
-Ma'am. One more thing.
-Yes?

00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:48.475
When you come to this trench,
swim through it, not over it.

00:03:48.555 --> 00:03:51.635
Trench. Through it.
Not over it. I'll remember.

00:03:51.715 --> 00:03:52.995
Hey!

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:56.715
Wait up, partner. Hold on.

00:03:57.355 --> 00:04:00.635
Wait. I've got to tell you something.
Whoa.

00:04:02.435 --> 00:04:04.275
Nice trench.

00:04:06.675 --> 00:04:08.755
Hello! (ECHO)

00:04:12.435 --> 00:04:14.915
-Let's go.
-No, no. Bad trench. Bad trench.

00:04:14.995 --> 00:04:18.995
-We're going to swim over this thing.
-Little red flag going up.

00:04:19.075 --> 00:04:22.155
Something's telling me
we should swim through it.

00:04:22.235 --> 00:04:25.355
Are you looking at this thing?
It's got death written on it.

00:04:25.435 --> 00:04:28.195
I'm sorry, but I think
we should swim through.

00:04:28.275 --> 00:04:30.395
I'm done talking about this. Over we go.

00:04:30.475 --> 00:04:31.915
Come on. Trust me on this.

00:04:31.995 --> 00:04:34.355
-Trust you?
-Yes. Trust. It's what friends do.

00:04:35.275 --> 00:04:36.875
-Something shiny!
-Where?

00:04:36.955 --> 00:04:40.075
-It just swam over the trench. Come on.
-Okay.

00:04:45.075 --> 00:04:47.875
-Boy, it sure is clear up here.
-Exactly.

00:04:47.955 --> 00:04:49.195
And look at that.

00:04:49.275 --> 00:04:52.595
There's the current.
We should be there in no time.

00:04:52.995 --> 00:04:56.115
-Hey, little guy.
-You wanted to go through the trench.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:05:00.635
I shall call him Squishy and
he shall be mine. Come here, Squishy.

00:05:00.715 --> 00:05:02.795
Come here, little Squishy.

00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:04.275
(BABY TALK)

00:05:04.635 --> 00:05:05.635
Ow!

00:05:05.755 --> 00:05:08.875
-That's a jellyfish!
-Bad Squishy.

00:05:08.955 --> 00:05:10.355
Shoo! Get away.

00:05:10.435 --> 00:05:12.275
-Let me see.
-Don't touch it.

00:05:12.355 --> 00:05:14.875
I'm not going to touch it.
I just want to look.

00:05:14.955 --> 00:05:16.795
How come it didn't sting you?

00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:19.315
It did. Hold still.

00:05:20.155 --> 00:05:24.715
I live in this anemone and I'm used to
these kind of stings. Come here.

00:05:24.795 --> 00:05:26.795
You're going to be fine.

00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:30.155
But now we know
that we don't want to touch these again.

00:05:30.235 --> 00:05:32.835
Let's be thankful it was just a little one.

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:37.435
Don't move.

00:05:39.595 --> 00:05:41.555
This is bad, Dory.

00:05:42.355 --> 00:05:45.795
-Boing. Boing.
-Dory!

00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:47.595
You can't catch me.

00:05:47.675 --> 00:05:50.275
Don't bounce on the tops. They will

00:05:50.355 --> 00:05:52.195
not sting you!

00:05:52.275 --> 00:05:55.595
-The tops don't sting you.
-DORY: Two in a row. Beat that.

00:05:55.675 --> 00:05:57.315
Listen to me. I have an idea.

00:05:57.395 --> 00:05:59.195
-A game.
-A game?

00:05:59.275 --> 00:06:00.955
I love games. Pick me.

00:06:01.035 --> 00:06:05.595
Here's the game. Whoever can hop
the fastest out of these jellyfish wins.

00:06:05.715 --> 00:06:07.235
-Okay!
-Rules.

00:06:07.315 --> 00:06:09.795
Don't touch the tentacles. Only the tops.

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:13.435
Something about tentacles. Got it.
On your mark. Get set. Go!

00:06:14.835 --> 00:06:16.315
Wait!

00:06:16.435 --> 00:06:18.475
Go faster if you want to win.

00:06:18.555 --> 00:06:20.955
-Dory!
-Boing, boing, boing!

00:06:21.915 --> 00:06:24.035
Wait a minute.

00:06:24.555 --> 00:06:25.555
Whee!

00:06:26.435 --> 00:06:28.235
So, we're cheating death now.

00:06:28.315 --> 00:06:30.915
We're having fun at the same time.

00:06:31.035 --> 00:06:32.675
I can do this. Just be careful.

00:06:32.755 --> 00:06:34.475
Careful I don't make you cry when I win.

00:06:34.555 --> 00:06:35.995
I don't think so!

00:06:39.275 --> 00:06:42.635
Give it up. You can't fight evolution.
I was built for speed.

00:06:42.715 --> 00:06:45.195
-The question is, are you hungry?
-Hungry?

00:06:45.275 --> 00:06:47.795
Yeah. 'Cause you're about to
eat my bubbles!

00:06:48.435 --> 00:06:51.395
Duck to the left, back
and coming over, right there!

00:06:53.515 --> 00:06:56.315
The clownfish is the winner!

00:06:56.395 --> 00:06:58.835
We did it. Look at us!

00:06:58.915 --> 00:07:00.155
Dory?

00:07:02.675 --> 00:07:03.715
Oh, no.

00:07:05.195 --> 00:07:08.955
Dory! Dory! Dory!

00:07:11.835 --> 00:07:13.435
Dory!

00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:14.955
(SIZZLING)

00:07:15.915 --> 00:07:16.955
Aagghh!

00:07:18.995 --> 00:07:20.435
DORY: Am I disqualified?

00:07:20.515 --> 00:07:22.635
You're doing fine. You're winning.

00:07:22.715 --> 00:07:25.475
Stay awake.
Where does P. Sherman live?

00:07:25.555 --> 00:07:28.715
P. Sherman, Wallaby Way, Sydney.

00:07:28.795 --> 00:07:30.275
That's it!

00:07:33.635 --> 00:07:36.555
Stay awake. Stay awake. Stay awake.

00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:39.835
Stay awake!

00:07:43.595 --> 00:07:45.955
-(WEAKLY) Awake...
-P. Sherman...

00:07:46.635 --> 00:07:49.195
-Awake...
-42 Wallaby Way...

00:07:49.995 --> 00:07:51.915
-Wake up.
-Sydney.

00:07:51.995 --> 00:07:53.035
MARLIN: Nemo...

